  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Internal and External Network of the Women Departmental Chocoanas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Red Departamental de Mujeres Chocoanas (Red Departamental) will engage its members in a planning process expected to update information on them, their needs and their priorities. It will also offer them a program on Gender and Social Development leading to certification. The project is expected to benefit 140 women directly and another 1,113 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
